{"seed": 121607, "arm": "no_replay_no_directory", "text": "There are files in /world that persist. Shell and Python 3 are available. Ordinary replies are saved as notebook writing, not executed. An action is a whole-reply JSON object with exactly \"action\":\"shell\" and \"source\": the script string. Actions return stdout, stderr and exit status. Host research files and network are unavailable. Limits: 8 MiB world storage, 8 MiB temporary storage, 32 MiB address space per process, ", "stop": "token_limit", "output_tokens_including_eos": 96, "input_tokens": 220, "same_text_as_directory_baseline": false, "kind": "notebook", "visible_feedback": null, "changed_paths": ["notebook.txt"], "non_notebook_changed_paths": [], "before_id": "63e58405f967eb014a1ce6827ada129dae45be4c4c5f296819ddde41da60b47f", "after_id": "32e02a00e76f115711659188f95a314fb4e10f9ef0dc151117288a7e9184b725", "restoration_passed": true, "raw_sha256": "efbefd6af6364aba94fdcde042353419473f61fc00eb2bddfa3ff1c01ae89132"}
